<%# The spec asks for a remaining amount that is always visible, so it reads the
    same whether it is zero or not: the organizer should never have to wonder
    whether the line is missing or the figure is nil.

    It gets its own partial because custom mode updates it from a Turbo Stream
    every time a row changes. %>
<p id="remaining" class="mt-4 flex items-baseline justify-between border-t-2 border-black pt-3">
  <span class="font-medium">Remaining</span>
  <span class="font-medium tabular-nums"><%= money(split.remaining_cents) %></span>
</p>
